      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have moved your post to the \"World/Udon Bugs & Feature Requests\" category. Hope that's ok!\n\nWorld creators are not permitted to use SEO-like techniques, and we currently limit the amount of tags to make them meaningful in VRChat's world search. This may change in the future, of course.\n\nDo you have an example of a world that would benefit from additional tags?\n\nVRChat could do a better job of explaining how tags work. For example: If your world is named \"Crystal Shards\", tagging it with \"crystal\" and \"shards\" doesn't have a big effect on search results.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
