  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Having only 5 tags to a world makes it fairly hard to properly tag a world, especially if you have certain prefab systems like audiolink and such that you would like to be searchable. I dont really see the reason tags have to be limited to such a small ammount, so seeing this changed would be fantastic for world searchability",
